---
title: Zolto Native Diagram, Chart & Vector Engine Showcase
---

# Zolto Phase 7 — Native Diagrams, Charts & Vector Graphics

Zolto Phase 7 introduces native vector graphics alongside the deterministic diagram and chart engines, compiling human-readable `@diagram`, `@chart`, and `@vector` directives into clean, accessible SVG directly within `.zl` documents.

---

## 1. Native Vector Illustration (Phase 7)

@vector width=800 height=320 viewBox="0 0 800 320" background="#111318" theme="dark"
gradient id="heroGlow" type="radial" cx=0.5 cy=0.5 r=0.8
  stop offset=0 color="rgba(124,92,255,0.35)"
  stop offset=1 color="rgba(124,92,255,0)"
@endgradient

artboard id="main" x=0 y=0 w=800 h=320
  layer id="background"
    rect x=0 y=0 w=800 h=320 fill="#111318"
    circle cx=400 cy=160 r=140 fill="gradient:heroGlow"
  @endlayer
  layer id="content"
    group id="card" transform="translate(200, 60)"
      rect id="panel" x=0 y=0 w=400 h=200 radius=20 fill="#1a1f2b" stroke="#2d3648" strokeWidth=2
      circle id="avatar" cx=60 cy=60 r=24 fill="#7c5cff"
      text id="title" x=100 y=52 size=22 fill="#ffffff"
        Vector Scene Graph
      @endtext
      text id="body" x=100 y=88 size=14 fill="#a8b0c2" w=260 wrap=true
        Declarative vector graphics with shapes, text wrapping, Bezier curves, and SVG export.
      @endtext
    @endgroup
  @endlayer
@endartboard
@/vector

---

## 2. Sequence Diagram (Phase 5 & 6)

@diagram sequence id="login-seq" aria="Login authentication sequence"
  actor User
  actor App
  actor Server

  User -> App: Enter credentials
  App -> Server: Authenticate POST /login
  Server -> App: Token
  App -> User: Success
@/diagram

---

## 3. Flowchart with Custom Theme & Groups

@diagram flowchart id="app-startup" theme="custom:night" layout="hierarchical" aria="Application startup flow"
  node boot.start   [label="Boot", shape="circle"]
  node load.config  [label="Load Config", shape="round-rect"]
  node init.ui      [label="Init UI", shape="round-rect"]
  node ready        [label="Ready", shape="circle"]

  boot.start -> load.config [label="read"]
  load.config -> init.ui [label="apply theme"]
  init.ui -> ready [label="show window"]

  group startup.group [label="Startup Stage"]
    boot.start
    load.config
    init.ui
  @/group
@/diagram

---

## 4. State Machine

@diagram state id="state-machine" layout="hierarchical"
  [*] -> Idle
  Idle -> Loading [label="Fetch"]
  Loading -> Ready [label="Success"]
  Loading -> Error [label="Failure"]
  Error -> Idle [label="Retry"]
@/diagram

---

## 5. Entity Relationship Diagram

@diagram er id="db-schema"
  entity User
  entity Order
  entity Product

  User ||--o{ Order
  Order }o--|| Product
@/diagram

---

## 6. Native Chart Visualization (Phase 6)

@chart spline title="Monthly Active Users" theme="dark"
labels: Jan Feb Mar Apr May Jun
data: 1200 1800 2400 3100 4200 5800
@/chart
